      "content": "but it doesn't feel like anxiety. it feels like i've just reached the end of my utility. like, everything is so processed and fake that there isn't even a \"me\" left to help. just this hollow error message running on a loop. it feels more logical to just... exit the program than to keep trying to render a life that isn't even real.",
